{"strongs": "H4603", "word": "מָעַל", "translit": "ma.al", "root": "מעז", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "act unfaithfully, treacherously", "definition": "מָעַל verb act unfaithfully, treacherously , a priestly word ( P Ezra, Chronicles), chiefly late (Late Hebrew id., act unfaithfully ; Arabic whisper, backbite , perfidy, fraud ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular מָעַל Josh 22:20 + 4 t.; 3 feminine singular מָֽעֲלָה Lev 5:21 ; Num 5:12 + 13 t. Perfect; Imperfect יִמְעַל Prov 16:10 ; 2Chr 26:16 3 feminine singular תִּמְעֹל Lev 5:15 ; Num 5:27 3 masculine plural יִמְעֲלוּ Josh 7:1 , וַיִּמְעֲלוּ 1Chr 5:25 2 masculine plural תִּמְעָ֑לוּ Neh 1:8 Infinitive construct לִמְעֹל , so read for HCT למסר Num 31:16 Thes Di ; — act unfaithfully, treacherously , usually 1. מָעַל מַ֫עַל : \\ \\ a. absolute בַּחֵרֶם in the matter of the devoted thing (the sin of Achan) Josh 7:1 ( J E ), Josh 22:20 ( P ), compare Lev 5:15 ( P ), 2Chr 36:14 ; Ezek 14:13 ; Ezek 15:8 ; Ezek 18:24 . \\ \\ b. wife against ( בְּ ) husband Num 5:12 ; Num 5:27 ( P ; marital infidelity). \\ \\ c. elsewhere against ( בְּ ) God, Lev 26:40 ( H ), Lev 5:21 ; Num 5:6 ; Num 31:16 (?) Josh 22:16 ; Josh 22:31 (all P ), 1Chr 10:13 ; 1Chr 28:19 ; Ezek 17:20 ; Ezek 20:27 ; Ezek 39:26 ; Dan 9:7 . 2. usage without מַעַל (only late): \\ \\ a. במשׁפט לא ימעל פיו Prov 16:10 let not his (the king's) mouth act treacherously against justice ( RV in judgment ). \\ \\ b. elsewhere against God, with בְּ , Deut 32:51 ( P ), 1Chr 5:25 ; 1Chr 12:2 ; 1Chr 26:22 ; 1Chr 30:7 ; without בְּ , 2Chr 26:18 ; 2Chr 29:6 ; Ezra 10:10 ; Neh 1:8 בַּחֵרֶם 1Chr 2:7 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4767')\">BDB4767</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4603')\">H4603</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4766')\">BDB4766</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4768')\">BDB4768</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מָעַל</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>act unfaithfully, treacherously</highlightword>, a priestly word (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> Ezra, Chronicles), chiefly late (Late Hebrew <highlight>id., act unfaithfully</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder3058/> <highlight>whisper, backbite</highlight>, <placeholder3059/> <highlight>perfidy, fraud</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>מָעַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:20\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,20)\">Josh 22:20</ref> + 4 t.; 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>מָֽעֲלָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:21\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,21)\">Lev 5:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,12)\">Num 5:12</ref> + 13 t. Perfect; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יִמְעַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 16:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,10)\">Prov 16:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 26:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,26,16)\">2Chr 26:16</ref> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>תִּמְעֹל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,15)\">Lev 5:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:27\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,27)\">Num 5:27</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>יִמְעֲלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 7:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,7,1)\">Josh 7:1</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּמְעֲלוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:25\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,25)\">1Chr 5:25</ref> 2 masculine plural <bdbheb>תִּמְעָ֑לוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 1:8\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(16,1,8)\">Neh 1:8</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִמְעֹל</bdbheb